— they live in the `FSE*`/`HUF*` prefix groups in `SYMBOLS.md`. v01–v04 keep their entropy code file-static.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Feature matrix\n\n| version | (a) dictionaries | (b) direct `decompressContinue` | (c) ZBUFF streaming | (d) `findFrameSizeInfoLegacy` | (d) `getFrameParams` |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| v01 | no | yes (`ZSTDv01_decompressContinue` + `resetDCtx` + `nextSrcSizeToDecompress`) | no | yes | no |\n| v02 | no | yes | no | yes | no |\n| v03 | no | yes | no | yes | no |\n| v04 | streaming only (`ZBUFFv04_decompressWithDictionary`) | yes | yes (`ZBUFFv04_*`, uses `decompressInit`) | yes | no |\n| v05 | yes (`ZSTDv05_decompress_usingDict`, `ZSTDv05_decompressBegin_usingDict`, `ZBUFFv05_decompressInitDictionary`) | yes (`decompressBegin`/`decompressBegin_usingDict` + `nextSrcSizeToDecompress` + `decompressContinue`) | yes (`ZBUFFv05_*`) | yes | yes (`ZSTDv05_getFrameParams` → `ZSTDv05_parameters`) |\n| v06 | yes (`ZSTDv06_decompress_usingDict`, `ZSTDv06_decompressBegin_usingDict`, `ZBUFFv06_decompressInitDictionary`) | yes | yes (`ZBUFFv06_*`) | yes | yes (`ZSTDv06_getFrameParams` → `ZSTDv06_frameParams`) |\n| v07 | yes, incl. digested DDict (`ZSTDv07_createDDict`/`freeDDict`/`decompress_usingDDict`) | yes | yes (`ZBUFFv07_*`, + `createDCtx_advanced`) | yes | yes (`ZSTDv07_getFrameParams` → `ZSTDv07_frameParams`) |\n\nOther notes:\n- No version exposes a `nextInputType` entry point (that concept exists only in the modern `ZSTD_nextInputType`); v01–v04 instead expose `ZSTDv0N_resetDCtx`, which v05–v07 dropped in favor of `decompressBegin`/`decompressBegin_usingDict`.\n- `findFrameSizeInfoLegacy` is uniform across all 7 versions: `void ZSTDv0N_findFrameSizeInfoLegacy(const void* src, size_t srcSize, size_t* cSize, unsigned long long* dBound)` — and it is the only legacy function every version implements identically in signature.\n- `ZSTD_findFrameSizeInfoLegacy` post-processes results: clamps `compressedSize > srcSize` to `ERROR(srcSize_wrong)`, and derives `nbBlocks = decompressedBound / ZSTD_BLOCKSIZE_MAX` with an assert that `decompressedBound` is `ZSTD_BLOCKSIZE_MAX`-aligned."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2059,"cache_read_input_tokens":53987,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2059,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01GSqUUrNK5snWiE4eiUmyG7","session_id":"f3f9022d-a72c-4fdb-a0a0-2ee15f7b56e5","uuid":"d1f313b0-06c5-472c-9956-1234afa43ab1","timestamp":"2026-08-14T20:57:21.761Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Enumerate legacy decoder API surface"}
