asedBlockCompressors[4][3]` indexed `[dictMode][strat - ZSTD_greedy]`.\n\nSelector: `if (ZSTD_rowMatchFinderUsed(strat, useRowMatchFinder)) -> row table else -> blockCompressor table`.\n\n```c\n/* zstd_compress.c:225-245 */\nZSTD_rowMatchFinderSupported(s)      = (s >= ZSTD_greedy && s <= ZSTD_lazy2)          /* 3..5 */\nZSTD_rowMatchFinderUsed(s, mode)     = ZSTD_rowMatchFinderSupported(s) && mode == ZSTD_ps_enable\nZSTD_resolveRowMatchFinderMode(mode, cParams):\n    if (mode != ZSTD_ps_auto) return mode;              /* explicit enable/disable wins */\n    mode = ZSTD_ps_disable;\n    if (!ZSTD_rowMatchFinderSupported(cParams->strategy)) return ZSTD_ps_disable;\n    if (cParams->windowLog > 14) mode = ZSTD_ps_enable;  /* THE auto trigger */\n    return mode;\n```\n\nEnum values: `ZSTD_fast=1, ZSTD_dfast=2, ZSTD_greedy=3, ZSTD_lazy=4, ZSTD_lazy2=5,\nZSTD_btlazy2=6, ZSTD_btopt=7, ZSTD_btultra=8, ZSTD_btultra2=9`\n(`zstd.h:336-347`, `ZSTD_STRATEGY_MIN=ZSTD_fast`, `ZSTD_STRATEGY_MAX=ZSTD_btultra2`).\n`ZSTD_noDict=0, ZSTD_extDict=1, ZSTD_dictMatchState=2, ZSTD_dedicatedDictSearch=3`\n(`zstd_compress_internal.h:551-556`).\n\ndictMode is derived at runtime by `ZSTD_matchState_dictMode()` (`zstd_compress_internal.h:1071-1078`):\n```c\nZSTD_window_hasExtDict(ms->window) ? ZSTD_extDict\n  : ms->dictMatchState != NULL ? (ms->dictMatchState->dedicatedDictSearch ? ZSTD_dedicatedDictSearch\n                                                                         : ZSTD_dictMatchState)\n  : ZSTD_noDict\n```\n\n### Full matrix (row = one (strategy, dictMode, rowMatchFinder) triple)\n\n| strategy | dictMode | rowMatchFinder | chosen ZSTD_compressBlock_* symbol |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| ZSTD_fast (1) | ZSTD_noDict | n/a (never row) | `ZSTD_compressBlock_fast` |\n| ZSTD_fast | ZSTD_extDict | n/a | `ZSTD_compressBlock_fast_extDict` |\n| ZSTD_fast | ZSTD_dictMatchState | n/a | `ZSTD_compressBlock_fast_dictMatchState` |\n| ZSTD_fast | ZSTD_dedicatedDictSearch | n/a | **NULL — unreachable