=> **64** for strategies 1..6, **32** for btopt,\n  **16** for btultra, **8** for btultra2; but only **6** when `HUF_repeat_valid`.\n* `set_repeat` if `HUF_compressXX_repeat` reports `repeat != HUF_repeat_none`.\n* `set_basic` if `cLitSize == 0 || cLitSize >= srcSize - ZSTD_minGain(srcSize, strategy)`.\n* `set_rle` if `cLitSize == 1 && (srcSize >= 8 || allBytesIdentical(src, srcSize))`.\n* else `set_compressed`.\n* Header widths: compressed `lhSize = 3 + (srcSize >= 1 KB) + (srcSize >= 16 KB)` (**1024**,\n  **16384** boundaries); raw/RLE `flSize = 1 + (srcSize > 31) + (srcSize > 4095)` (**31**, **4095**).\n* Stream count: `singleStream = srcSize < 256`; also forced to 1 when\n  `repeat == HUF_repeat_valid && lhSize == 3`. 4 streams need\n  `MIN_LITERALS_FOR_4_STREAMS = 6`. `HUF_BLOCKSIZE_MAX = 128 KB` (`common/huf.h:25`).\n* HUF flags: `strategy < ZSTD_lazy && srcSize <= 1024` -> `HUF_flags_preferRepeat`;\n  `strategy >= HUF_OPTIMAL_DEPTH_THRESHOLD (== ZSTD_btultra)` -> `HUF_flags_optimalDepth`.\n* `suspectUncompressible` = `nbSeq == 0 || litSize/nbSeq >= SUSPECT_UNCOMPRESSIBLE_LITERAL_RATIO (20)`\n  (`zstd_compress.c:2886, 2924`).\n* Superblock literals metadata uses different thresholds (`:3632-3736`):\n  `COMPRESS_LITERALS_SIZE_MIN = 63`, `minLitSize = HUF_repeat_valid ? 6 : 63`;\n  `largest == srcSize` -> `set_rle`; `largest <= (srcSize >> 7) + 4` -> `set_basic`.\n\n### Sequences-section shapes (`ZSTD_selectEncodingType`, `zstd_compress_sequences.c:156-235`)\n* `nbSeq == 0` -> `zstd_compress.c:2954-2958` copies the previous FSE tables and returns with\n  **no** sequence-section byte at all. Reachable with literal-only input (no match >= minMatch).\n* `mostFrequent == nbSeq`: `set_basic` if `isDefaultAllowed && nbSeq <= 2`, else `set_rle`.\n* `strategy < ZSTD_lazy`: `set_repeat` if `repeatMode == FSE_repeat_valid && nbSeq < 1000`;\n  `set_basic` if `nbSeq < dynamicFse_nbSeq_min` (`((1 << defaultNormLog) * (10 - strategy)) >> 3`,\n  i.e. 28..36 for offsets, 56..72