ctID_*, ZSTD_CCtx_loadDictionary*, refCDict, refPrefix*, DCtx equivalents\n (h) dictBuilder: ZDICT_trainFromBuffer, _cover, _fastCover, optimize variants, _legacy,\n     ZDICT_finalizeDictionary, ZDICT_addEntropyTablesFromBuffer\n (i) frame utilities: ZSTD_findFrameCompressedSize, ZSTD_getFrameContentSize,\n     ZSTD_findDecompressedSize, ZSTD_decompressBound, ZSTD_frameHeaderSize, ZSTD_isFrame,\n     ZSTD_isSkippableFrame, ZSTD_readSkippableFrame, ZSTD_writeSkippableFrame,\n     ZSTD_writeLastEmptyBlock, ZSTD_decompressionMargin, ZSTD_getFrameHeader(_advanced)\n (j) raw entropy: FSE_compress_usingCTable/normalizeCount/writeNCount/readNCount/buildCTable_wksp/\n     buildDTable_wksp/decompress_wksp, HUF_compress1X_repeat/4X_repeat/usingCTable/writeCTable_wksp/\n     readCTable/decompress1X*/4X*/readDTableX1/X2_wksp/readStats, HIST_count*\n (k) xxhash: ZSTD_XXH32/64 one-shot + streaming reset/update/digest + canonical\n (l) deprecated ZBUFF_*: compressInit(_advanced/Dictionary), compressContinue, compressFlush,\n     compressEnd, decompressInit(Dictionary), decompressContinue + recommended*Size\n (m) legacy decoders v01..v07: ZSTDv0N_decompress, ZSTDv0N_findFrameSizeInfoLegacy,\n     streaming ZSTDv0N_decompressContinue, ZBUFFv0N_* — note which versions support dictionaries\n     and which support streaming, and note that ZSTD_decompress on a legacy frame auto-dispatches\n     via ZSTD_LEGACY_SUPPORT=5 (so only v05,v06,v07 frames are handled by the modern entry point —\n     VERIFY this from c_src/src/legacy/zstd_legacy.h and the CMake define ZSTD_LEGACY_SUPPORT=5).\n (n) pool: POOL_create/create_advanced/resize/add/tryAdd/joinJobs/sizeof/free\n (o) low-level compress internals that are exported: ZSTD_buildBlockEntropyStats, ZSTD_buildCTable,\n     ZSTD_encodeSequences, ZSTD_selectEncodingType, ZSTD_seqToCodes, ZSTD_compressLiterals,\n     ZSTD_noCompressLiterals, ZSTD_compressRleLiteralsBlock, ZSTD_compressSuperBlock,\n     ZSTD_splitBlock, ZSTD_get1BlockSummary, ZST