ainLog+1), 31)` with `hashLog=chainLog=6` -> 512 B cap)  [ ] |\n|118| `ZSTD_selectBlockCompressor` + `ZSTD_fillHashTable` + `ZSTD_fillDoubleHashTable` + `ZSTD_row_update` + `ZSTD_insertAndFindFirstIndex` + `ZSTD_updateTree` + `ZSTD_dedicatedDictSearch_lazy_loadDictionary` | direct oracle: `selectBlockCompressor` for all 9 strategies x 4 dictModes x `useRowMatchFinder` {enable, disable} (skip the 6 NULL slots); table fills after `compressBegin_usingDict` with `ZSTD_dtlm_fast|full` x `ZSTD_tfp_forCCtx|forCDict` x dict content {8, 1K, 64K}  [ ] |\n|119| `ZSTD_buildBlockEntropyStats` + `ZSTD_selectEncodingType` + `ZSTD_buildCTable` + `ZSTD_encodeSequences` + `ZSTD_seqToCodes` + `ZSTD_crossEntropyCost` + `ZSTD_fseBitCost` + `ZSTD_compressLiterals` + `ZSTD_noCompressLiterals` + `ZSTD_compressRleLiteralsBlock` | driven from `ZSTD_getSeqStore()` snapshots at each encoding-type branch (`mostFrequent==nbSeq` with `nbSeq<=2` and `>2`; `nbSeq` below/above `dynamicFse_nbSeq_min`; `FSE_repeat_valid` with `nbSeq` below/above 1000; offsets with `max<=28` and `>28`); literals at litSize {0,1,5,6,31,32,63,64,255,256,1023,1024,16383,16384,131072} x `HUF_repeat_none|check|valid` x `disableLiteralCompression` 0/1 x strategy {fast, lazy, btultra2}  [ ] |\n|120| `ZSTD_compressSuperBlock` + `ZSTD_splitBlock` + `ZSTD_get1BlockSummary` + `ZSTD_ldm_generateSequences` / `_blockCompress` / `_fillHashTable` / `_adjustParameters` / `_getTableSize` / `_getMaxNbSeq` / `_skipSequences` / `_skipRawSeqStoreBytes` + `ZSTD_referenceExternalSequences` + `ZSTD_invalidateRepCodes` + `ZSTD_resetSeqStore` + `ZSTD_reset_compressedBlockState` + `ZSTD_checkContinuity` + `ZSTD_loadCEntropy` + `ZSTD_loadDEntropy` | `splitBlock` at levels 0..4 on 128 KB homogeneous and heterogeneous blocks; LDM `hashLog` {6,20,30} x `minMatchLength` {4,64,4096} x `bucketSizeLog` {1,3,8} x `hashRateLog` {0,7} on 4 MB long-match input; `loadCEntropy`/`loadDEntropy` on dictionaries with `hasZeroWeights` true/false, `maxSymbolValue` 2